{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"tokyo-midnight","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Tokyo Midnight","description":"A dark theme with neon accents from the city at night.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Tokyo Midnight","path":"themes/tokyo-midnight.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/tokyo-midnight.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Tokyo Midnight\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1a1b26\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#a9b1d6\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#16161e\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#16161e\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#16161e\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#16161e\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#292e42\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#33467c\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#14141b\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#16161e\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#101014\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#7aa2f7\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#7aa2f7\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#7aa2f7\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#33467c\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#292e4280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#7aa2f7\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#101014\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f7768e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#9ece6a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#e0af68\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f7768e\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#565f89\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9ece6a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9e64\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#bb9af7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2ac3de\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7aa2f7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9e64\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#73daca\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f7768e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e0af68\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7dcfff\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Tokyo Midnight\n\nA dark theme with neon accents from the city at night.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Tokyo Midnight** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Tokyo Night palette.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1a1b26` |\n| Text | `#a9b1d6` |\n| Accent | `#7aa2f7` |\n| Keywords | `#bb9af7` |\n| Strings | `#9ece6a` |\n| Functions | `#7aa2f7` |\n| Types | `#2ac3de` |\n| Comments | `#565f89` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}